  {
    "name": "06 持久化类图",
    "title": "SignalLab · 逻辑持久化类图",
    "subtitle": "UML 类表示 SQLite 表 · 明确可空外键、多重性与删除语义 · 基于全部现有迁移",
    "footer": "依据：migrations/001_init.sql:4–98；002_task_scheduler.sql:6–37；003_signal_script.sql:6–54。多重性按 SQL 约束标注。",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "tbl_file",
        "type": "class",
        "x": 70,
        "y": 170,
        "w": 355,
        "h": 235,
        "text": "«table» file_version",
        "fill": "orange",
        "sections": [
          "PK id: INTEGER\ncontent_hash: TEXT {unique}\nstored_relative_path: TEXT {unique}\noriginal_name / byte_size\ncreated_utc: TEXT",
          "SHA-256 内容寻址\n外部原文件不参与项目删除"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tbl_source",
        "type": "class",
        "x": 605,
        "y": 170,
        "w": 365,
        "h": 235,
        "text": "«table» signal_source",
        "fill": "blue",
        "sections": [
          "PK id: INTEGER\nsource_type: GENERATED | CSV | WAV\nsource_key: TEXT {unique}\nFK file_version_id: INTEGER?\nsource_path / parameters_json",
          "文件版本删除 → 外键置 NULL\nGENERATED 不要求文件版本"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tbl_signal",
        "type": "class",
        "x": 1130,
        "y": 170,
        "w": 395,
        "h": 235,
        "text": "«table» signal_record",
        "fill": "green",
        "sections": [
          "PK id: INTEGER\nFK source_id: INTEGER {unique}\nsample_rate / sample_count\nsample_blob: BLOB / sample_hash\nsignal_name / signal_unit\nsignal_source_label",
          "来源删除 → 信号记录级联删除\n导入事务保证来源与记录一起保存"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tbl_script",
        "type": "class",
        "x": 70,
        "y": 540,
        "w": 355,
        "h": 230,
        "text": "«table» script_history",
        "fill": "purple",
        "sections": [
          "PK id: INTEGER\nscript_text / source_hash\nstatus / created_utc / finished_utc\nerror_line? / error_column?\nerror_message: TEXT",
          "独立执行历史，无信号外键\nRUNNING 仅能转为一次终态"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tbl_feature",
        "type": "class",
        "x": 605,
        "y": 540,
        "w": 365,
        "h": 230,
        "text": "«table» feature_result",
        "fill": "green",
        "sections": [
          "PK id: INTEGER\nFK task_id: INTEGER\nfeature_name: TEXT\nnumeric_value: REAL? / value_text\nunit: TEXT",
          "UNIQUE(task_id, feature_name)\n任务删除 → 特征级联删除"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tbl_task",
        "type": "class",
        "x": 1130,
        "y": 540,
        "w": 395,
        "h": 285,
        "text": "«table» analysis_task",
        "fill": "blue",
        "sections": [
          "PK id: INTEGER\nFK signal_record_id: INTEGER?\nsignal_name / status\nalgorithm_name / algorithm_version\nparameters_json / input_hash\noutput_hash / UTC 时间 / error_message",
          "信号删除 → 外键置 NULL\n终态含 CANCELLED / INTERRUPTED\n特征与 SUCCEEDED 状态原子提交"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tbl_audit",
        "type": "class",
        "x": 70,
        "y": 800,
        "w": 355,
        "h": 120,
        "text": "«table» operation_log",
        "fill": "gray",
        "sections": [
          "PK id / operation / entity_type\nentity_id? / detail / created_utc",
          "无实体外键；审计记录独立保留"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tbl_note",
        "type": "note",
        "x": 605,
        "y": 810,
        "w": 450,
        "h": 105,
        "text": "schema_migration 由迁移执行器管理。\nsignal_source 在 SQL 上允许无信号记录；\n应用事务保证正常业务中一来源一记录。\n任务中心快照不对应持久化业务表。",
        "fill": "gray"
      },
      {
        "id": "tbl_delete_note",
        "type": "note",
        "x": 490,
        "y": 435,
        "w": 590,
        "h": 70,
